Ray traced reflections in Advanced Video Options: a list of None, Rays and Hybrid that sets
d3d12_RTReflections, the water's reflection by rays of XRenderD3D12 (DXR 1.1), greyed out with
another renderer or a graphics card without ray tracing. The rows of the page move closer together
to make a seventh one, where Ambient Occlusion was: the first and the last stay. Written against
VideoAdv.lua as video-ambient-occlusion.patch leaves it (the name sorts after it, and Patch
Scripts.cmd applies the patches in that order) and applied by Patch Scripts.cmd to
FCData/Scripts.pak.

